# FUXA Project Context

## Tech Stack
- **Frontend**: Angular 18, Angular Material, RxJS, Socket.io-client, TailwindCSS (`client/`)
- **Backend**: Node.js 18 LTS, Express, Socket.io, Winston (`server/`)
- **Docs**: MkDocs Material (`docs/`)
- **Package manager**: npm (separate `package.json` per package; no root workspace)

## Folder Map
| Path | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `client/src/app/` | Angular UI (editor, gauges, alarms, devices) |
| `server/api/` | REST API route handlers |
| `server/runtime/` | Device drivers, storage, sockets, business logic |
| `server/integrations/` | Node-RED contrib nodes |
| `server/test/` | Mocha integration/security tests |
| `docs/` | MkDocs documentation source |
| `app/` | Electron packaging |

## Commands
```bash
# Backend
cd server && npm install && npm start        # dev server :1881
cd server && npm test                        # Mocha tests

# Frontend
cd client && npm install && npm start        # ng serve
cd client && npm run build && npm run lint

# Docs
pip install "mkdocs<2.0" mkdocs-material && mkdocs serve
```

## NEVER Do
- NEVER commit secrets, tokens, `.env`, or `server/_appdata/` runtime data
- NEVER commit `node_modules/`, `client/dist/`, or `server/_pkg/` build output
- NEVER add npm dependencies without explicit user approval
- NEVER edit files outside the requested scope (no drive-by refactors)
- NEVER use Node.js versions below 18 LTS
